          "text": "So the answer is fifteen.",
          "display": "= 15",
          "cue": "answer"
        },
        {
          "id": "b07",
          "text": "Watch out for these traps. If you subtract first, you get twenty-four. If you double the three instead of squaring, you get sixteen.",
